<title>USA: TABLE - GTE Corp Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - GTE Corp Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.70		    $0.66</p>
<p> Net			    671			642</p>
<p> Revs			 5,692		    5,293</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     956			972</p>
<p>				 6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.39		    $1.29</p>
<p> Net			  1,336		    1,258</p>
<p> Revs			 3,218		    2,997</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     958			973</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Costs associated with new data investments cut net income by $25 million, or $0.03 per share, in 1997 Q2 and six months. Excluding these costs, Q2 operating earnings were $0.73 per share.</p>
<p>Q2 1996 includes pre-tax gain from program to dispose of non-strategic local exchange properties of $12 million, which increased net income by $8 million, or $0.01 per share.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1736))</p>
